# Obj_SetAttackBoxes: a box allocation failing (ruling 5, 2). Run at the first call of
# Op2_SetAttackBox ($003784, `moveq #1,d7 / bsr Obj_SetAttackBoxes`: a2 = its one inline box
# spec, a4/a6 the object), with d7 = 1 as that op sets it; the object's first attack-box handle
# ($C(a4)) is 0 (a box set growing past the boxes it had) and the object pool has no free block
# (g_ObjPoolFree = 0), so ObjPool_Alloc fails and the remaining specs are skipped (loc_00380E)
# before the count is stored.
at $003784

case pool_empty
reg d7 = 1
w a4 + $C = 0
b $FFFFF4B0 = 0
